BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.1 Tm /F1 9.7 Tf 13.2 TL (We refer to the Commission's informal inquiry of 14 November 2025 concerning recent user notifications relating to) Tj T* (password resets and questions raised by certain users about access to their accounts. The Company takes these) Tj T* (matters seriously and is responding co-operatively and in good faith. This letter is provided on a without-prejudice) Tj T* (basis and does not constitute a notification under Article 33 of the GDPR.) Tj T* ET
