BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.1 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.7 Tf 0 0 0 rg (During the autumn the Company commenced a staged credential-hygiene programme \(referred to internally as the) Tj T* /F3 9.7 Tf (Trust Reset) Tj /F1 9.7 Tf ( programme\) under which affected users were asked to reset passwords and under which certain) Tj T* (sessions were invalidated. The programme is described to users as a proactive account-security measure. The) Tj T* (notifications the Commission refers to are understood to arise from that programme.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
