BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.3 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.7 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The Company is conducting a review, with the assistance of external forensic advisers and outside counsel, of) Tj T* (certain anomalous activity observed in its logging in the second half of October. ) Tj /F3 9.7 Tf ([Inserted, tracked: the review) Tj T* (concerns a defined window in mid-to-late October 2025.]) Tj /F1 9.7 Tf ( That review is ongoing. The Company is not in a position) Tj T* (to draw final conclusions at this time and respectfully asks the Commission to note the preliminary nature of the) Tj T* (position set out below.) Tj T* ET
