BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.1 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.7 Tf 0 0 0 rg (It is important to distinguish between two questions that are sometimes conflated. The first is whether any personal) Tj T* (data was ) Tj /F2 9.7 Tf (accessed) Tj /F1 9.7 Tf ( \(in the sense of being read or rendered readable by a person or system without authorisation\).) Tj T* (The second is whether any personal data was ) Tj /F2 9.7 Tf (exfiltrated) Tj /F1 9.7 Tf ( \(in the sense of being copied or removed from the) Tj T* (Company's environment\). ) Tj /F3 9.7 Tf ([Comment \227 G.O.: keep this distinction; do not elide.]) Tj T* ET
